<mxCell id="note" value="CloudFront serves the SPA and forwards /api to ALB. ALB distributes requests to isolated Fargate tasks across two AZs. NAT-A/NAT-B provide AZ-local outbound access to Supabase, ECR, Secrets Manager, CloudWatch Logs and channel APIs. The S3 Gateway Endpoint routes S3 traffic privately." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e7f5ff;strokeColor=#4ba3d9;fontColor=#1a5375;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="455" y="905" width="1055" height="47" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
